/-! ## 5. The T2 terminal

`V` and `G` are the **literal** brackets of `Pt.JTop.value` / `Box.JTop.part i`
(proved equal to the tree slots in `V_mem`/`G_mem`), so the slack below is one
pure-integer kernel computation: `Nat.sqrt` inside the tree never reaches it. -/

def V : DC := ⟨(208 : ℤ), (1289340062625080665100801239318215368118343168452829437333178 : ℤ), (1289375300795288276193076394001733569392841768240138057133142 : ℤ)⟩

def G : Fin 3 → DC
  | 0 => ⟨(205 : ℤ), (31794309450224123230755351050743881821099470233420851487922 : ℤ), (1420084845111271785077904624843850213919051622041033875333182 : ℤ)⟩
